'''Team Vitality''' is a [[:Category:France|French]] esports organization which entered ''VALORANT'' in early 2021. <ref name="Vitality 2021 roster">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamVitality/status/1357358251868778496|title=We are absolutely delighted to enter another Riot Games' competitive scene!|date=2021-02-04|author='''Team Vitality'''}}</ref>

